# Pairs with RootHasOneRoot. Root promotion creates a new root with only one
# child, dropping the sibling side of the split.
MODULE: PromoteRootCreatesUnaryRoot
TARGET: RootHasOneRoot
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: root promotion leaves the new root with one child
PERTURBS: PromoteRoot

--- FIND
           newRootEntries ==
               <<[node |-> oldRoot, separator |-> NoKey],
                 [node |-> sibling, separator |-> pending.separator]>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: only one half of the split is attached to the new root.
           newRootEntries ==
               <<[node |-> oldRoot, separator |-> NoKey]>>
--- END
